      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Values are soundly derived from ci/short_description (Dell laptop -> hardware_device, AWS -> cloud_service). However the query is about travel-expense declines; this categorises IT assets, largely redundant with existing category/ci fields and only loosely tied to the decline signal. Modest analytical leverage."
